==Chapters==
* Chapter 1: ''[[DPA11|The Legendary Pokémon, Captured]]''
* Chapter 2: ''[[DPA12|A Battle Of Wills]]''
* Chapter 3: ''[[DPA13|The Battle Rages On]]''
* Special Chapter: ''[[DPAS1|Deoxys, The Phantom Pokémon! (Part 1)]]''
* Special Chapter: ''[[DPAS2|Deoxys, The Phantom Pokémon! (Part 2)]]''

==Important events==
* Hareta and the Gym Leaders battle [[Team Galactic]] at [[Lake Valor]].
* Team Galactic captures {{p|Azelf}}.
* Hareta is revealed to have met Deoxys.
* Hareta saves Deoxys from Team Galactic.

==Party changes==
* [[Mitsumi]] is revealed to have a {{p|Glaceon}} and {{p|Milotic}}.

==Gym Battles==
* Despite the lack of a Gym Battle, [[Byron]] awards Hareta with the Mine Badge after Team Galactic's retreat.

==D・P Snapshots==
